====================================================================================================
    STANDS PAPER24 sec 2-3: the decoupling locus W_0 = 0, rho_3/rho = 1/(s_0 - 1), s_0 >= 2, pi_3/pi_grav <= 0.044
           statements about the sector's background, no matter coupling involved
