           normalisation of the dead coupling; in the single-metric coupling a_0 enters through J's argument scale and the static law is the T-B double filter's (g03d)
    FALLS  PAPER24 sec 5: gamma = 1 from the disformal matter metric; alpha_1 = 8 f_s; v_residual <= 4.6 m/s
